{"seq":1,"slug":"open-implementations","title":"开源实现与复现指南","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-frontier-research/jepa-joint-embedding-world-models/getting-hands-dirty/open-implementations","wordCount":1540,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"开源实现与复现指南\">开源实现与复现指南</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>上手 JEPA 有三条深度递进的路径，投入产出完全不同：<strong>用权重</strong>（拿预训练编码器提特征，零训练成本）、<strong>接任务</strong>（冻结骨干换读出头或做 AC 后训练）、<strong>从头复现</strong>（重走一遍预训练管线）。绝大多数工程需求止步于前两条，从头复现的价值主要在教育与研究消融。选错路径是新手最常见的浪费——为了提个特征却去复现百万小时级预训练，或者反过来想验证机制假设却只加载了权重。本篇按路径给出经过核验的资产地图与操作要点；评测怎么跑见 <a href=\"probing-evaluation\">探针评测方法</a>，各代模型的架构差异回溯至 <a href=\"../motivation-mechanism/jepa-family-tree\">JEPA 家族：I-JEPA、V-JEPA 与 V-JEPA 2</a>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    Q{需求是什么} --&gt;|只要特征| A[加载官方权重&lt;br/&gt;transformers 集成]&#10;    Q --&gt;|要适配任务| B[冻结骨干 + 轻量头&lt;br/&gt;或 AC 后训练]&#10;    Q --&gt;|要研究机制| C[从头复现预训练]&#10;    A --&gt; D[探针评测定基线]&#10;    B --&gt; D&#10;    C --&gt; E[消融实验]\">flowchart TD\n    Q{需求是什么} --&gt;|只要特征| A[加载官方权重&lt;br/&gt;transformers 集成]\n    Q --&gt;|要适配任务| B[冻结骨干 + 轻量头&lt;br/&gt;或 AC 后训练]\n    Q --&gt;|要研究机制| C[从头复现预训练]\n    A --&gt; D[探针评测定基线]\n    B --&gt; D\n    C --&gt; E[消融实验]</pre><h2 id=\"官方资产地图\">官方资产地图</h2><p>先给全景。I-JEPA 的官方训练代码在 <code>facebookresearch/jepa</code> 仓库（含配置文件驱动的掩码采样实现），这是唯一需要克隆的「训练侧」仓库；V-JEPA 与 V-JEPA 2 的主要公开形态是 Hugging Face 权重而非独立代码库，推理与微调已并入主流工具链。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>资产</th>\n<th>形态</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>github.com/facebookresearch/jepa</code></td>\n<td>PyTorch 训练代码</td>\n<td>从头复现 I-JEPA、改掩码策略</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>facebook/vjepa2-vitl-fpc16-256-ssv2</code></td>\n<td>HF 权重</td>\n<td>小分辨率快速试验</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>facebook/vjepa2-vith-fpc64-256</code></td>\n<td>HF 权重</td>\n<td>中等算力的特征提取</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>facebook/vjepa2-vitg-fpc64-384</code></td>\n<td>HF 权重</td>\n<td>追求最强表征的离线分析</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>facebook/vjepa2-vitg-fpc32-384-diving48</code></td>\n<td>HF 权重</td>\n<td>细分动作场景对照</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>transformers <code>vjepa2</code> 集成</td>\n<td><code>VJEPA2Model</code> 等类</td>\n<td>生产环境的特征管线</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>命名规则从左到右可拆解为：模型规模（vitl / vith / vitg）、fpc 后缀的数字对应每片段帧数、末尾数字为输入分辨率、额外后缀如 ssv2 表示在特定数据集上微调过的变体。选型时帧数与分辨率的乘积近似决定显存占用，ViT-g 加高帧率配置对消费级显卡并不友好。</p>\n<h2 id=\"用权重的最小工作路径\">用权重的最小工作路径</h2><p>transformers 已原生集成 V-JEPA 2，几行代码即可拿到视频片段的特征：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import torch&#10;from transformers import AutoVideoProcessor, AutoModel&#10;&#10;model_id = &quot;facebook/vjepa2-vitl-fpc16-256-ssv2&quot;&#10;processor = AutoVideoProcessor.from_pretrained(model_id)&#10;model = AutoModel.from_pretrained(model_id)&#10;&#10;inputs = processor(video_frames, return_tensors=&quot;pt&quot;)&#10;with torch.no_grad():&#10;    feats = model(**inputs).last_hidden_state\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> transformers </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> AutoVideoProcessor, AutoModel</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">model_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"facebook/vjepa2-vitl-fpc16-256-ssv2\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">processor </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> AutoVideoProcessor.from_pretrained(model_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">model </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> AutoModel.from_pretrained(model_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">inputs </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> processor(video_frames, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">return_tensors</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"pt\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.no_grad():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    feats </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> model(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">**</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">inputs).last_hidden_state</span></span></code></pre></div><p>三个实践要点：其一，<code>last_hidden_state</code> 的形状随 fpc 配置变化，下游头的设计要与所选 checkpoint 的帧数匹配；其二，处理器负责重采样与归一化，自写预处理极易引入静默偏差，宁可多查一次文档；其三，不同变体的训练目标一致但微调历史不同，跨变体比较特征质量时必须固定同一个 checkpoint。拿到特征后的标准动作是立刻跑一组探针建立基线——协议细节在 <a href=\"probing-evaluation\">探针评测方法</a>，此处只强调顺序：先基线、再改造。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从头复现-i-jepa-的要点清单\">从头复现 I-JEPA 的要点清单</h2><p>决定复现时，<code>facebookresearch/jepa</code> 仓库的结构本身就是一份设计文档：配置驱动、掩码采样独立成模块。复现中最值得花时间的地方按优先级排列如下：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>掩码几何先行：目标块的数量、尺寸与位置分布直接决定表征语义层级，任何结果异常先查掩码采样日志；</li>\n<li>目标侧稳定性：EMA 动量与 stop-gradient 的接线错误不会报错，只会让损失悄悄收敛到平凡解，务必监控嵌入方差；</li>\n<li>数据管线的解码吞吐：视频解码常成为瓶颈，预解码成帧缓存往往比优化模型更划算；</li>\n<li>学习率日程：长 warmup 加余弦衰减，早期步长过大造成的坍缩不可逆。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"ac-后训练与自采数据的实操\">AC 后训练与自采数据的实操</h2><p>想让权重变成自己场景的世界模型，动作条件后训练是投入最小的改造点。官方配方给了明确的可行性参照：V-JEPA 2-AC 仅用不足 62 小时的无标注机器人视频完成，意味着后训练的数据门槛远低于直觉。实操要点有三条。第一，冻结预训练编码器、只训预测器与动作编码层——这既是省算力的选择，也是保住通用表征的关键，微调骨干反而容易把百万小时学到的动力学洗掉。第二，动作序列按 chunk 对齐视频片段，边界处的状态延续要用重叠帧处理，错位是最常见的静默 bug。第三，损失仍是表征距离而非像素重建，验证训练是否健康的最快办法是在留出轨迹上做一步预测误差监控。</p>\n<p>若要自采数据，优先保证视角与动作的多样性而非时长——同一机位的重复操作对泛化的边际贡献极低。采集完成后先复现官方的抓取类任务作为冒烟测试，再扩展到自己的任务族；规划侧的消费方式见 <a href=\"planning-with-latent-models\">用潜空间模型做规划</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"算力预算的估算框架\">算力预算的估算框架</h2><p>精确到卡时的预算因分辨率与迭代数而异，但估算框架是通用的。单步训练成本近似为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>≈</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>iter</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>enc</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>ctx</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>tgt</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>tgt</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>pred</mtext></msub><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C \\approx T_{\\text{iter}} \\cdot \\left( c_{\\text{enc}} \\cdot N_{\\text{ctx}} + c_{\\text{tgt}} \\cdot N_{\\text{tgt}} + c_{\\text{pred}} \\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">iter</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">enc</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ctx</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">tgt</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">tgt</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">pred</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中编码器成本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>enc</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_{\\text{enc}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">enc</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 随参数量线性增长，上下文与目标的 token 数由掩码几何决定——这就是为什么加大目标块比加深模型便宜得多，也是 V-JEPA 2 论文把缩放收益分解为数据、参数、迭代三部分的原因（详见 <a href=\"../evidence-applications/vjepa2-capabilities\">V-JEPA 2 的能力面</a> 的缩放分解节）。实践中的省钱顺序：先降分辨率再减帧数、目标块数量宁少勿碎、ViT-L 配置足以验证几乎所有机制假设。至于动作条件的后训练，其数据量级远小于预训练，瓶颈通常在机器人数据的获取而非算力，这条线的完整算法语境见 <a href=\"../evidence-applications/planning-with-latent-models\">用潜空间模型做规划</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>三条路径的投入依次递增，先用权重跑通探针基线永远是对的起点；</li>\n<li>训练侧资产只有 I-JEPA 官方仓库，视频侧以 HF 权重加 transformers 集成为主干；</li>\n<li>复现成败几乎取决于掩码几何与目标侧稳定性这两个非模型因素；</li>\n<li>算力预算先砍分辨率与帧数，机制实验用 ViT-L 就够。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"开源实现与复现指南","id":"开源实现与复现指南"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"官方资产地图","id":"官方资产地图"},{"level":2,"text":"用权重的最小工作路径","id":"用权重的最小工作路径"},{"level":2,"text":"从头复现 I-JEPA 的要点清单","id":"从头复现-i-jepa-的要点清单"},{"level":2,"text":"AC 后训练与自采数据的实操","id":"ac-后训练与自采数据的实操"},{"level":2,"text":"算力预算的估算框架","id":"算力预算的估算框架"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"开放问题清单","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-frontier-research/jepa-joint-embedding-world-models/evidence-applications/open-problems"},"next":{"title":"探针评测方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-frontier-research/jepa-joint-embedding-world-models/getting-hands-dirty/probing-evaluation"}}